T1  - BlockTransit-AI: a decentralized artificial intelligence framework for adaptive energy-efficient public transportation in Indian metropolitan cities during geopolitical fuel crises
AU  - Bose, Rajesh
AU  - Sutradhar, Shrabani
AU  - Roy, Sandip
AU  - Khan, Arfat Ahmad
AU  - Ayub, Muhammad Shoaib
AU  - Koo, Insoo
