T1  - BAROP: A Blockchain-Auditable and Adversary-Resilient On-Chain Peer-to-Peer learning framework for EV charging intrusion detection
AU  - Amara Korba, Abdelaziz
AU  - Bouchiha, Mouhamed Amine
